 result←ns ExecExternalFns y;fns;__arg;nc;qdmx;valence;call
⍝ Executes an embedded function call exactly once. `ns` is always passed as the right argument; anything
⍝ following the function name in the call is passed as the left argument. A dyadic tradfn called without
⍝ such an argument gets ⍬ as left argument.
 result←''
 (fns __arg)←{∨/' '''∊⍵:(¯1+⌊/⍵⍳' '''){(⍺↑⍵)(A.DLB ⍺↓⍵)}⍵ ⋄ ⍵ ⍬}y
 nc←⎕NC⊂fns
 :If 3≠⌊|nc
     ns.report,←⊂'Unknown external function: <',fns,'>'
 :Else
     :If (1=×nc)∧0=2⊃1 ⎕AT fns
         ns.report,←⊂'External function <',fns,'> is niladic but must not!'  ⍝ We cannot perform this check on class methods!
     :Else
         valence←¯2                                         ⍝ Ambivalent: dfns and class methods
         :If 3.1=nc                                         ⍝ Only a tradfn has a fixed valence (⎕AT reports 2 for a dfn)
             valence←2⊃1 ⎕AT fns
         :EndIf
         :If 0<≢__arg                                       ⍝ An argument was given: it goes to the left
         :OrIf 2=valence                                    ⍝ A dyadic tradfn without an argument gets ⍬
             call←'result←__arg ',fns,' ns'
         :Else
             call←'result←',fns,' ns'
         :EndIf
         :Trap 0                                            ⍝ Whatever happens in the function must be reported, not crash MarkAPL
             ⍎call                                          ⍝ Exactly once: never "try again" after a failure
             :If ¯1=×≡result
                 ns.report,←⊂'External function <',fns,'> is niladic but must not!'  ⍝ Only this can explain a negative result
                 result←''
             :EndIf
         :Else
             qdmx←⎕DMX
             :If 6=qdmx.EN
             :AndIf 0=≢__arg
             :AndIf {'⍺'∊⍵/⍨{~⍵∨≠\⍵}⍵=''''}2⊃qdmx.DM           ⍝ A VALUE ERROR on ⍺: the function needs an argument
                 ns.report,←⊂'External function <',fns,'> requires a left argument'
             :Else
                 ns.report,←⊂'External function <',fns,'> did crash'
             :EndIf
             result←''
         :EndTrap
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
